    "annoyed, arrogant, bored, confused, crazy, cry, curious, damage, despair, " ..
    "disappointed, disgusted, down, excitement, fight, Interest, jealousy, " ..
    "kiss, panic, shame, sulking, tearsjoy, thinking, tired, worried"

